1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,839
My what? Rizz? Like rice?

2
00:00:02,839 --> 00:00:03,779
Oh,

3
00:00:03,779 --> 00:00:04,660
rizz.

4
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,040
My rizz, kid.

5
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,460
I showed up on time

6
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,179
with my shoes shined,

7
00:00:10,179 --> 00:00:11,820
and I had hair then,

8
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:12,380
with the comb

9
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:13,500
in my back pocket

10
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,380
in case of wind.

11
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,339
I asked her questions,

12
00:00:16,339 --> 00:00:17,140
and then I shut up

13
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,739
and listened to the answers.

14
00:00:18,739 --> 00:00:19,579
That's it.

15
00:00:19,579 --> 00:00:20,379
That's the rizz.

16
00:00:21,859 --> 00:00:23,679
Showing up and shutting up.

17
00:00:23,679 --> 00:00:24,320
Your grandmother

18
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,660
married me for it.

19
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:25,839
Well,

20
00:00:26,699 --> 00:00:27,859
for that and the dancing.

